#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support Ditana development through Liberapay, Buy Me a Coffee, GitHub Sponsors, or Patreon."
msgstr "Sustegnai il svilup da Ditana cun Liberapay, Buy Me a Coffee, GitHub Sponsors u Patreon."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Donate"
msgstr "Far ina donaziun"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"Ditana is the result of years of work, built on the conviction that a Linux "
"distribution should explain its choices rather than hide them. It is "
"completely free and open source, and its continued development relies on "
"community support."
msgstr ""
"Ditana è il resultat d’onns da lavur ed è fundada sin la persvasiun ch’ina "
"distribuziun Linux duess explitgar sias decisiuns empè da las zuppar. Ella è "
"cumplettamain gratuita ed open source, e ses svilup cuntinuant dependa dal "
"sustegn da la communitad."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"By donating, you enable me to keep enhancing Ditana — exploring new "
"features, responding to user feedback, and maintaining the level of detail "
"this project aims for. Every contribution makes a difference."
msgstr ""
"Cun Vossa donaziun ma pussibilitais Vus da cuntinuar a meglierar Ditana – "
"d’explorar novas funcziuns, da respunder als resuns da las utilisadras e "
"dals utilisaders e da mantegnair il nivel da detagl che quest project ha sco "
"finamira. Mintga contribuziun fa ina differenza."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where donations go"
msgstr "Nua che las donaziuns van"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"Donations are processed through **acrion innovations GmbH**, a Swiss company "
"I founded to manage the financial side of my projects. While the company "
"provides the legal and financial framework, **acrion** represents my work as "
"a solo developer. Your support directly funds Ditana's ongoing development, "
"server infrastructure, and the time required to keep up with Arch's rolling "
"release."
msgstr ""
"Las donaziuns vegnan elavuradas tras **acrion innovations GmbH**, ina firma "
"svizra che jau hai fundà per administrar la part finanziala da mes projects. "
"Entant che la firma furnescha il rom giuridic e finanzial, represchenta "
"**acrion** mia lavur sco sviluppader che lavura sulet. Voss sustegn "
"finanziescha directamain il svilup cuntinuant da Ditana, l’infrastructura da "
"servers ed il temp ch’i dovra per tegnair pass cun il rolling release dad "
"Arch."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to support Ditana"
msgstr "Co sustegnair Ditana"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**Liberapay**](https://liberapay.com/acrion/donate) — recurring donations, "
"no platform fee."
msgstr ""
"[**Liberapay**](https://liberapay.com/acrion/donate) – donaziuns regularas, "
"nagina taxa da plattafurma."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**Buy Me a Coffee**](https://buymeacoffee.com/acrion) — one-off support."
msgstr ""
"[**Buy Me a Coffee**](https://buymeacoffee.com/acrion) – in sustegn unic."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**GitHub Sponsors**](https://github.com/sponsors/acrion) — if you already "
"donate to other open-source work via GitHub."
msgstr ""
"[**GitHub Sponsors**](https://github.com/sponsors/acrion) – sche Vus "
"faschais gia donaziuns per autras lavurs open source via GitHub."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "[**Patreon**](https://patreon.com/acriondev) — tiered support."
msgstr ""
"[**Patreon**](https://patreon.com/acriondev) – sustegn en differents nivels."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "Thank you for helping keep Ditana alive, growing, and uncompromising."
msgstr ""
"Grazia fitg che Vus gidais a mantegnair Ditana viva, en creschientscha e "
"senza cumpromiss."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "— Stefan"
msgstr "– Stefan"
